    "directions": [
      "In a pan, add turmeric powder, oil and roast it for 10-15 seconds.",
      "Add degi red chili powder, coriander powder, cumin powder, garam masala and mix it well.",
      "Add dry mango powder and cook for a few seconds. Transfer it to a bowl, add mayonnaise and mix it well.",
      "Keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a bowl, add refined flour, salt to taste, oil, curd, water and knead it into a semi soft dough.",
      "Apply oil and keep it aside for 10-15 minutes to rest.",
      "Divide the dough into lemon size balls, apply oil and flatten the dough with the help of a rolling pin.",
      "Make a semi thick roti and add white sesame seeds.",
      "In a tawa, heat oil, place prepared roti and cook it well on both the sides.",
      "Transfer it to a plate and keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a bowl, add beetroot, green chilies, salt to taste, onion, vinegar and mix it well.",
      "Keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a bowl, add garlic, hung curd, mayonnaise, oregano, degi red chili powder, salt to taste, lemon juice, chicken breast and mix it well.",
      "Keep it aside for 10-15 minutes to marinate.",
      "In a grilled pan, heat oil, place marinated chicken and sear it for 5-6 minutes on both sides.",
      "Transfer it to a plate and cut the chicken into strips.",
      "In a pan, heat oil, add onion, seared chicken and sautÃ© it for 5-6 minutes on high flame.",
      "Add tandoori mayonnaise, coriander leaves and toss it well.",
      "Keep it aside for further use.",
      "Take the prepared shawarma roti, apply hung curd, tandoori mayonnaise and spread evenly.",
      "Place prepared salad, sauteed chicken and roll it.",
      "Serve hot with prepared dip."
    ],
